Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfsntfs

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfsntfs/archive/refs/tags/20260827.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libfsntfs-20260827-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libfsntfs-20260827-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libfsntfs-20260827-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfsntfs-20260827-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfsntfs1-20260827-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfsntfs-devel-20260827-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libfsntfs-20260827-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libfsntfs)
  /usr/bin/fsntfsinfo.exe
  /usr/bin/fsntfsmount.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libfsntfs.README
  /usr/share/doc/libfsntfs/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libfsntfs/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libfsntfs/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libfsntfs/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libfsntfs/New Technologies File System (NTFS).asciidoc
  /usr/share/doc/libfsntfs/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/fsntfsinfo.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/fsntfsmount.1.gz

(libfsntfs1)
  /usr/bin/cygfsntfs-1.dll

(libfsntfs-devel)
  /usr/include/libfsntfs.h
  /usr/include/libfsntfs/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libfsntfs/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libfsntfs/error.h
  /usr/include/libfsntfs/extern.h
  /usr/include/libfsntfs/features.h
  /usr/include/libfsntfs/types.h
  /usr/lib/libfsntfs.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libfsntfs.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libfsntfs.3.gz

(python312-libfsntfs)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyfsntfs.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll

